{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20975","headline":"杨生青花紫石砚歌 · 李贺","name":"杨生青花紫石砚歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"端州石工巧如神，踏天磨刀割紫云。\n佣刓抱水含满唇，暗洒苌弘冷血痕。\n纱帷昼暖墨花春，轻沤漂沫松麝薰。\n乾腻薄重立脚匀，数寸光秋无日昏。\n圆毫促点声静新，孔砚宽顽何足云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}